          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "8b.close,closely \n\nclose接近，靠近：dlosely紧紧地，紧密地.\n\nclosely connected,stand close \n87.il,sick \n\nin做表语，sick定、表均可.a sick boay.\n\n88. good, well \n\ngood形容词，weu副词，但指身体状况是形容词.He is well again.\n89. quiet, silent, still \n\nquiet安静的，可以发出小的声音；silent不发出声音，但可以动；stil完\n全不动，完全无声响.He stand there stil.他站在那，一动不动，也不说话\n90. hard, hardly \n\nhard努力，haurdy.work hardI can hardy believe i.\n91.able,capable \n\nabl与不定式to do用capable与用He is capable of doing \n92. almost, nearly \n\n二者均为“几乎，差不多”和否定词适用用almosb.almost nobbody.\n93. late, lately \n\nlate迟，晚; lately最近,近来.I havern't seen him lately.\n94.living, alive, live, livlly \n\nliving，alive，live均为活着的；living定.表均可；alive定、表均可，定语\n后置；live只能做定语；lively意为活泼的.\n\nall the living people= all the people alive.\n95. excited,exciting \n\nexcited使人兴奋的，exciting令人兴奋的.\n\nI'm excited. The news is exciting.\n\n.96: deep deeply \n\n",
